repository-code: "https://github.com/AllUsersAreTaken/Parallel-Inference"
keywords:
  - llm-inference
  - llama.cpp
  - cuda
  - rtx-4060
  - speculative-batching
  - self-consistency
  - edge-inference
abstract: >-
  Measurement harnesses and analysis for reusing spare decode compute on a
  consumer GPU (RTX 4060, 8 GB): a mixed decode+chunk knee harness, a
  parallel-stream cost curve (kernel regimes, unified-KV sharing, unshared
  tails), an offline early-exit probe tool, and a live N-way
  parallel-reasoning harness with agreement-based stopping.
